// and once over the migrated forge (`migrated`). G-ID (§10.2) runs EXACTLY this from system/code/educoreForge,
// nohup-detached with PID and log; the two <phase> tokens are the ONLY variation. Pinned: --vectorize=true stated
// explicitly (build.js:555-559 defaults it true, but a stage-off/vectorize-off run mints a different id
// trivially); the WARM cache by absolute path; the round-trip stage inside the recipe; </dev/null (graphBuilder
// blocks on non-TTY stdin); heap 20000; a SCRATCH standardsDatabase under system/dataStores/graphBuilder/, never
// the golden's. Containers are DEV_<label> and disposed (GNC-001). ONE-MACHINE-ONLY, licence-gated (Ed-Fi's
// MetaEd bytes are gitignored). DATA ONLY in F3a — the build-driven gates are F3b/F3c/F3d's proofs.
